# Conditional Default Values Example
# Default unconditional child values alongside conditional overrides for specific parent values.
# From Story121/Story122: CPL Concepts Parser/Analyzer — Conditional

concepts
	Country=[Values[USA, Canada]]
	# Default regions for all countries
	Region=[Values[North, South, East, West]]
	# Override for USA
	Country[USA] => Region=[Values[Pacific, Mountain, Central, Eastern]]
